   "source": [
    "## 8. QC Summary, Saved Outputs, and Model-Ready Dataset Export\n",
    "\n",
    "This section summarizes preprocessing quality, saves the labels and metadata, and builds stacked arrays for downstream modeling.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Note:** The stacking section now builds datasets for **both SSAEP and SSVEP** conditions (resting is skipped)."
   ]
  },
  {
